  "quest.5BD5D82A832DACE3.title": "Disk Jockey",
  "quest.5BD5D82A832DACE3.quest_subtitle": "Craft or obtain 1024B Fluid Storage Block",
  "quest.5BD5D82A832DACE3.quest_desc": [
    "1024B Fluid Storage Block — a building block from the Refined Storage mod.",
    "",
    "Refined Storage is digital hoarding done right — disks, grids, and autocrafting for when your random block vomits ingredients faster than you can sort them.",
    "",
    "How to make it:",
    "• Craft it in a shaped pattern — open JEI and search the item for the exact grid layout.",
    "",
    "Skyblock tip: your random center block may eventually roll the parts — stash duplicates in storage until you have the full recipe."
  ],
